            "text": "<h3>Welcome to the Monti Coolers Ambassador Program! </h3><p>I first came up with Monti as a fly fishing guide in Wyoming and understand the value that strong industry partnerships can provide. </p><p>Our goal is to make sure that taste makers, guides, and influencers are able to get access to the Monti Cooler to share with the world and hopefully make their packs a bit lighter.<br/><br/>While we are still ironing the specific requirements for this program, we are generally looking for people that can get our message out there on a digital platform. This can include people with large social followers, photographers who can provide excellent content, outdoor guides with an eye for videography, etc... <br/><br/>Get together your relevant supporting documentation and apply now! Simply include why you think you'll be a good fit as well as any relevant portfolio, business website, or social handles. </p><p> </p><p>Qualifications: <br/>&gt;5000 Highly Engaged Followers on Instagram</p>"
